<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Malan to visit Europe and U.S..</title>
<headline>Brazil's Malan to visit Europe and U.S..</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Finance Minister Pedro Malan was due to fly to Europe to attend seminars and meetings in Switzerland, Britain, France and Germany, the Finance Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Malan was scheduled to take part in a conference in Geneva on November 20, to give a speech in London on November 21 and meet Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development (OECD) officials in Paris November 22.</p>
<p>On November 23, Malan will be in Berlin for the European Forum Berlin 1996.  </p>
<p>The following Monday, the Brazilian finance minister travels to New York for a seminar at the Federal Reserve Bank of New York and on November 26, he attends meetings with World Bank officials in Washington.</p>
<p>Malan returns to Brasilia on November 27.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
